{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533600/extras/1be1a4ae5ef311968c8c68ecb408f919.poster.avif?t=1766081617\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533600/extras/1be1a4ae5ef311968c8c68ecb408f919.webm?t=1766081617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533600/extras/1be1a4ae5ef311968c8c68ecb408f919.mp4?t=1766081617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodthief is an ultra-fast melee dungeon-runner where you use momentum to parkour through hazardous dungeons and brutally slash through enemies. Speed-run through haunted crypts and castles and learn what dark secrets lie beneath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 main levels + secrets / extra levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 collectable weapons with unique perks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom User Maps via Steam Workshop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with your friends and anyone in the world by racing their ghost.\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vanquish the Wicked. Drink Their Blood.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Bloodthief you play as a vampire, and the blood of undead foes fuels your abilities and propels you to insane speeds. Movement and combat are deeply intertwined\u2014you\u2019ll need to use both in a beautiful dance of skill and carnage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533600/extras/df7e2da7da7aaea6756e808e123b6808.poster.avif?t=1766081617\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533600/extras/df7e2da7da7aaea6756e808e123b6808.webm?t=1766081617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533600/extras/df7e2da7da7aaea6756e808e123b6808.mp4?t=1766081617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Ancient Dungeons. Acquire Hidden Powers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful secrets lie in the depths of Bloodthief's world. Delve into this\u00a0mystical land and uncover powerful loot and magical abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533600/extras/2720dc74b9136dda059cb400d131d4e1.poster.avif?t=1766081617\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533600/extras/2720dc74b9136dda059cb400d131d4e1.webm?t=1766081617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533600/extras/2720dc74b9136dda059cb400d131d4e1.mp4?t=1766081617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Your Abilities and Reap the Rewards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels full of branching paths, shortcuts, and secrets reward those with the skill and creativity to pull them off. Find the perfect path through labyrinthine dungeons and reap the rewards for your efforts.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodthief offers a challenging experience that invites the player to learn the deep and intertwined gameplay mechanics to progress and succeed. It will push you to your limits but leave you feeling like the ultimate killing machine by end.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A journey begins...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2533600/48cf9c1f4507c58236638e51235c3b2f1f274140.jpg"},{"name":"Doom Heretic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2533600/48cf9c1f4507c58236638e51235c3b2f1f274140.jpg"},{"name":"Better than dung","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2533600/48cf9c1f4507c58236638e51235c3b2f1f274140.jpg"},{"name":"A taste of godhood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2533600/2a4378a732974c1a12597e74b1b8596a431d78dc.jpg"},{"name":"Treasure Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2533600/cf8e00d8e14918eb26edc951f80dd48a753f7c03.jpg"},{"name":"Immortal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2533600/5492dbffda695dc0daaf9a5a4c5daf66a6782cd7.jpg"},{"name":"Down the Well","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2533600/5492dbffda695dc0daaf9a5a4c5daf66a6782cd7.jpg"},{"name":"Godspeed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2533600/cf8e00d8e14918eb26edc951f80dd48a753f7c03.jpg"},{"name":"Sweet Loot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2533600/5492dbffda695dc0daaf9a5a4c5daf66a6782cd7.jpg"},{"name":"Monster Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2533600/5492dbffda695dc0daaf9a5a4c5daf66a6782cd7.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2533600?t=1766081617","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2533600?t=1766081617","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533600/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766081617","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533600/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766081617","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains extreme violence and gore. Melee combat is bloody and gory. "},"demos":[{"appid":2941730,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533600/extras/1be1a4ae5ef311968c8c68ecb408f919.poster.avif?t=1766081617\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533600/extras/1be1a4ae5ef311968c8c68ecb408f919.webm?t=1766081617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533600/extras/1be1a4ae5ef311968c8c68ecb408f919.mp4?t=1766081617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodthief is an ultra-fast melee dungeon-runner where you use momentum to parkour through hazardous dungeons and brutally slash through enemies. Speed-run through haunted crypts and castles and learn what dark secrets lie beneath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 main levels + secrets / extra levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 collectable weapons with unique perks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom User Maps via Steam Workshop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with your friends and anyone in the world by racing their ghost.\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vanquish the Wicked. Drink Their Blood.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Bloodthief you play as a vampire, and the blood of undead foes fuels your abilities and propels you to insane speeds. Movement and combat are deeply intertwined\u2014you\u2019ll need to use both in a beautiful dance of skill and carnage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533600/extras/df7e2da7da7aaea6756e808e123b6808.poster.avif?t=1766081617\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533600/extras/df7e2da7da7aaea6756e808e123b6808.webm?t=1766081617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533600/extras/df7e2da7da7aaea6756e808e123b6808.mp4?t=1766081617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Ancient Dungeons. Acquire Hidden Powers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful secrets lie in the depths of Bloodthief's world. Delve into this\u00a0mystical land and uncover powerful loot and magical abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533600/extras/2720dc74b9136dda059cb400d131d4e1.poster.avif?t=1766081617\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533600/extras/2720dc74b9136dda059cb400d131d4e1.webm?t=1766081617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533600/extras/2720dc74b9136dda059cb400d131d4e1.mp4?t=1766081617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Your Abilities and Reap the Rewards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels full of branching paths, shortcuts, and secrets reward those with the skill and creativity to pull them off. Find the perfect path through labyrinthine dungeons and reap the rewards for your efforts.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodthief offers a challenging experience that invites the player to learn the deep and intertwined gameplay mechanics to progress and succeed. It will push you to your limits but leave you feeling like the ultimate killing machine by end.</p>","developers":["Blargis"],"dlc":[4026810],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533600/header.jpg?t=1766081617","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16 or later, Or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4GHZ Quad Core Or Higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 5 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 10 series Or Equivalent (Vulkan or DirectX 12 Support Required)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Vulkan or DirectX 12 Support Required</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Relatively modern dedicated graphics card (Vulkan support recommended)<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Vulkan or DirectX 12 Support Required</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2533600/85704848/212dd65715c8215d56554c812ff35c49d24faef6/1758552555/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758560169","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tra